 be out well before May 2019. If you're not moving in the next three months or so, you should be fine. They usually don't lock down addresses until a couple of weeks before shipping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-10T12:00:02-07:00","id":1259999,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Thanks so much. :^)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-10T17:22:56-07:00","id":1260051,"title":"","content":"So uh... I'm supposed to be moving in the next two months, and still don't know where I'm going yet. I feel like this could be an issue for me :/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares","name":"ArchonAres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T05:57:45-07:00","id":1260276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArchonAres</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1259684-c-tl-ks-question?p=1260051#post1260051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So uh... I'm supposed to be moving in the next two months, and still don't know where I'm going yet. I feel like this could be an issue for me :/</div> </div> </div> </div> My suggestion is to have them send it to a friend's or relatives house instead of yours, someone who isn't moving and then pick it up from their place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T06:36:30-07:00","id":1260279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArchonAres</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1259684-c-tl-ks-question?p=1260051#post1260051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So uh... I'm supposed to be moving in the next two months, and still don't know where I'm going yet. I feel like this could be an issue for me :/</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Like I said, they wait to as close to shipping as they can before locking down addresses. There is a good chance you'll know your address when the time comes. If not, do as ArchonAres said and have it shipped to an address you can get to easily to pick it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}